cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this guest, cite fbx-udim-unpack, whose UDIM tile rule it ports.
title: udim.elf -- UDIM unpack for polygon UVs (sandbox guest)
abstract: >-
  The UDIM unpack algorithm of fbx-udim-unpack as a godot-sandbox guest, without
  the FBX SDK. The host passes UVs and the corner count of each polygon; the guest
  returns one UDIM tile id per polygon (1001 + 10 * vPart + uPart, or -1 when the
  UV range is over one tile) and the UVs of polygons in a tile above 1001 put
  back into 0-1. The guest has no filesystem, sockets or host objects.
type: software
authors:
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/interactor-udim-unpack
